    <Mask>
      <Display/>
      <Description>Implements ground reaction force (if geardown is nonzero) for 3-wheel landing gear. Linear stiffness and damping are applied within stroke range, and (generally larger) mount stiffness and damping are applied beyond this range. 

Underlying gear.c function is from HL-20/LaRCsim, e.b.jackson@nasa.gov  </Description>
