      <Type>Sensor Model</Type>
      <Display>disp(&apos;bias/scf/noise&apos;)</Display>
      <Description>Add bias, scale factor, and white noise to a signal

- &apos;on/off&apos;: 1 = noise on, 0 = noise off.
- &apos;sigma&apos; : Standard deviation of white noise.
- &apos;seed&apos;  : Random number seed. Generated numbers
  change between each simulation run, but the random number 
  sequences do not change between Matlab sessions unless a 
  new seed is specified.
- &apos;bias&apos;  : Constant mean value offset of white noise.
- &apos;scale factor&apos; : Scale factor applied to original signal.</Description>
      <MaskParameter Name="noise_on" Type="edit">
        <Prompt>on/off</Prompt>
        <Value>SensorNoise.On</Value>
      </MaskParameter>
      <MaskParameter Name="sigma" Type="edit">
