    <P Name="RequestExecContextInheritance">off</P>
    <Mask>
      <Display/>
      <Description>Six Degree of Freedom Aircraft Simulation

Input forces are both linear forces and torques -&gt; [Fx Fy Fz Tl Tm Tn].
Inertia6 is a vector [Ixx Iyy Izz  Ixz Iyz Ixy], all positive
State Vector is [Vb pqr LatLonAlt PhiThetaPsi]

</Description>
      <Initialization>if (UnitOfLength==1), % ft
    Re=6.37043246e+06/.3048;
elseif (UnitOfLength==2), % m
    Re=6.37043246e+06;
end

</Initialization>
